{
  "sections": [
    {
      "id": "meeting_at_a_glance",
      "sentences": [
        {
          "text": "The meeting involves Sam Reyes and Hannah Voss from Northwind Advisory alongside Maya Okafor and Jonas Lindqvist from Brightmoor Renewables.",
          "citations": [
            "cal:M2"
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "The purpose is to walk through the revised PPA pricing and the board pre-read ahead of the upcoming board meeting.",
          "citations": [
            "cal:M2"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "client_snapshot",
      "sentences": [
        {
          "text": "Brightmoor Renewables is engaged for a scope including market pricing analysis, PPA negotiation strategy, risk assessment of contract structures, and drafting a formal board paper.",
          "citations": [
            "doc:D7"
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "The total fixed fee for the engagement is £48,000, exclusive of VAT and pre-approved expenses.",
          "citations": [
            "doc:D7"
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "The fee is payable in two equal instalments of £24,000, with 50% due upon formal project commencement and 50% upon delivery of the final board paper.",
          "citations": [
            "doc:D7"
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "The final board paper is due on 20 March 2026 for the board meeting scheduled for 24 March 2026.",
          "citations": [
            "doc:D7",
            "email:E38"
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Financial close is targeted for 30 June 2026, and Ashgrove Bank requires the PPA to be fully signed off before this date.",
          "citations": [
            "email:E41"
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ashgrove Bank requires the project to secure 70% contracted revenue to satisfy debt service coverage ratios.",
          "citations": [
            "doc:D8"
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Sources disagree on the Fenmoor project capacity: the document from 20 January 2026 confirmed it as 180 MW.",
          "citations": [
            "doc:D8"
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "The other source says the capacity was revised to 165 MW on 19 February 2026 due to a new turbine layout.",
          "citations": [
            "chat:C18"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "recent_news",
      "sentences": []
    },
    {
      "id": "where_we_left_off",
      "sentences": [
        {
          "text": "On 24 February 2026, Maya Okafor accepted a 12-year PPA duration but noted the 74/MWh pricing floor exceeds the 71/MWh limit approved by finance.",
          "citations": [
            "email:E51"
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "On 27 February 2026, Jonas Lindqvist requested that all figures in the board pre-read remain consistent with the lender model shared the previous week.",
          "citations": [
            "email:E56"
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "On 2 March 2026, the grid connection agreement for Fenmoor was signed with a target energisation date of late 2027.",
          "citations": [
            "email:E59"
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "On 5 March 2026, Jonas Lindqvist reported he was unable to access the shared project folder due to permission errors.",
          "citations": [
            "email:E63"
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "On 6 March 2026, Hannah Voss instructed Sam Reyes to lead with the pricing floor logic in the pre-read and press for technical study results.",
          "citations": [
            "email:E65"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "open_items",
      "sentences": [
        {
          "text": "Commitment: On 24 February 2026, Maya Okafor promised to deliver the grid-connection study by 6 March 2026 at the latest.",
          "citations": [
            "email:E51"
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Commitment: On 24 February 2026, Maya Okafor requested a reworked sensitivity table reflecting proposed pricing levels before the pre-read is circulated.",
          "citations": [
            "email:E51"
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Commitment: On 20 January 2026, Sam Reyes promised to circulate the agenda for weekly Thursday calls twenty-four hours in advance.",
          "citations": [
            "doc:D8"
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Jonas Lindqvist reported on 5 March 2026 that he still cannot access the shared project folder for the PPA work.",
          "citations": [
            "email:E63"
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "The final board paper must be ready by the 20 March 2026 deadline.",
          "citations": [
            "email:E38",
            "doc:D7"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "attendees",
      "sentences": [
        {
          "text": "Sam Reyes is a Senior Consultant at Northwind Advisory who serves as the day-to-day lead on all three engagements.",
          "citations": [
            "contact:P1"
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hannah Voss is a Partner at Northwind Advisory and the senior sponsor responsible for the Brightmoor Renewables relationship.",
          "citations": [
            "contact:P4"
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Maya Okafor is the Head of Commercial at Brightmoor Renewables, leads the PPA negotiation, and prefers short bullet updates.",
          "citations": [
            "contact:P8"
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Jonas Lindqvist is the Chief Financial Officer at Brightmoor Renewables who owns lender relations and the board paper.",
          "citations": [
            "contact:P9"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "talking_points_and_risks",
      "sentences": [
        {
          "text": "Address the pricing floor logic, as the current 74/MWh proposal exceeds the 71/MWh limit approved by Brightmoor finance.",
          "citations": [
            "email:E51",
            "email:E65"
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Confirm the project capacity for revenue modelling, as sources disagree: one document states 180 MW while a later chat reports a revision to 165 MW.",
          "citations": [
            "doc:D8",
            "chat:C18"
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Discuss the impact of delays in receiving updated operations and maintenance assumptions and grid connection timelines on the sensitivity analysis.",
          "citations": [
            "doc:D16"
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Verify if the grid-connection study promised for 6 March 2026 has been received from the technical team.",
          "citations": [
            "email:E51",
            "email:E65"
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ensure all figures in the board pre-read are consistent with the lender model as requested by the CFO.",
          "citations": [
            "email:E56"
          ]
        }
      ]
    }
  ]
}
